{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd69\u00a0<strong>Butcher Life\u00a0</strong> is an open-world business simulation game where you live the life of a countryside butcher. Starting from a simple Small house and a small budget, you\u2019ll work your way up by cutting meat, managing livestock, delivering orders, and building your own meat empire ,one steak at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/9cb5337f21f6a9d87f538b7d542f071b.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/9cb5337f21f6a9d87f538b7d542f071b.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/9cb5337f21f6a9d87f538b7d542f071b.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf04 Explore the Countryside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an open-world countryside village filled with life and charm, featuring diverse areas like farms, forests, markets, and delivery routes, each brimming with resources, activities, and opportunities to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/d69c491e4fc05ae01557716800fc4b1d.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/d69c491e4fc05ae01557716800fc4b1d.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/d69c491e4fc05ae01557716800fc4b1d.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\ude93 Start Small, Grow Big</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin your life in a caravan with nothing but a knife, a cooler, and a dream. Buy animals like cows and chickens from local farms, process the meat yourself, and sell it to various fast food restaurants with changing daily prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you earn money, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy better tools and machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your workspace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes and meat types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve quality and speed of your work</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/bcb53e559fa7296871ff6657122d57b2.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/bcb53e559fa7296871ff6657122d57b2.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/bcb53e559fa7296871ff6657122d57b2.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different methods to cut meat  from basic knives and manual tools to advanced machines as you level up your business. The better your tools, the faster and cleaner your work becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/30c7f882c40f9f16e1c1114460009c52.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/30c7f882c40f9f16e1c1114460009c52.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/30c7f882c40f9f16e1c1114460009c52.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and smart choices to earn money, upgrade your tools, and unlock new features. As you grow your business, you'll get the chance to open your very own butcher shop in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind your way to the top and build your meat empire, one steak at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/632d078343427d993ee05522cde6f224.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/632d078343427d993ee05522cde6f224.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/632d078343427d993ee05522cde6f224.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Build Your Butcher Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind your way from a basic setup to full ownership of a butcher shop, a barn, and eventually your own house. Manage animals, expand your production line, and deliver large orders to restaurants for bigger profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/fbcdb7946db548390a62db87db9d3da3.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/fbcdb7946db548390a62db87db9d3da3.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/fbcdb7946db548390a62db87db9d3da3.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf54 Sell to Funny Fast Food Chains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which restaurant to sell to each day, Each one has different prices, preferences, and attitudes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wants bulk quantity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another only accepts premium cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One might just want\u2026 chicken-shaped sausages?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart selling can mean the difference between surviving and thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd13 Your Story, Your Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no single path in Butcher Life. Whether you want to take it slow and live the quiet rural life, or go all-in on expansion and domination of the meat market, it\u2019s your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream butcher business and take over the countryside meat market NOW!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805140?t=1768687083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3805140?t=1768687083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/f53c92d180b80c1775cc90fb9a327cb1154f5078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768687083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/f53c92d180b80c1775cc90fb9a327cb1154f5078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768687083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd69\u00a0<strong>Butcher Life\u00a0</strong> is an open-world business simulation game where you live the life of a countryside butcher. Starting from a simple Small house and a small budget, you\u2019ll work your way up by cutting meat, managing livestock, delivering orders, and building your own meat empire ,one steak at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/9cb5337f21f6a9d87f538b7d542f071b.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/9cb5337f21f6a9d87f538b7d542f071b.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/9cb5337f21f6a9d87f538b7d542f071b.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf04 Explore the Countryside</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an open-world countryside village filled with life and charm, featuring diverse areas like farms, forests, markets, and delivery routes, each brimming with resources, activities, and opportunities to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/d69c491e4fc05ae01557716800fc4b1d.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><s