ork becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/30c7f882c40f9f16e1c1114460009c52.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/30c7f882c40f9f16e1c1114460009c52.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/30c7f882c40f9f16e1c1114460009c52.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills and smart choices to earn money, upgrade your tools, and unlock new features. As you grow your business, you'll get the chance to open your very own butcher shop in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind your way to the top and build your meat empire, one steak at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/632d078343427d993ee05522cde6f224.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/632d078343427d993ee05522cde6f224.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/632d078343427d993ee05522cde6f224.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Build Your Butcher Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grind your way from a basic setup to full ownership of a butcher shop, a barn, and eventually your own house. Manage animals, expand your production line, and deliver large orders to restaurants for bigger profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/fbcdb7946db548390a62db87db9d3da3.poster.avif?t=1768687083\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/fbcdb7946db548390a62db87db9d3da3.webm?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805140/extras/fbcdb7946db548390a62db87db9d3da3.mp4?t=1768687083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf54 Sell to Funny Fast Food Chains</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which restaurant to sell to each day, Each one has different prices, preferences, and attitudes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wants bulk quantity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another only accepts premium cuts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One might just want\u2026 chicken-shaped sausages?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart selling can mean the difference between surviving and thriving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd13 Your Story, Your Pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no single path in Butcher Life. Whether you want to take it slow and live the quiet rural life, or go all-in on expansion and domination of the meat market, it\u2019s your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream butcher business and take over the countryside meat market NOW!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mamkalo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simula